    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/536580402e099b55c125c2e900ef0de4.poster.avif?t=1752600612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/536580402e099b55c125c2e900ef0de4.webm?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/536580402e099b55c125c2e900ef0de4.mp4?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>\u00a0Church Crew</strong>\u00a0is a chaotic 4\u201312 player online social deduction game where penguins gather inside a  church to complete tasks, expose hidden threats, and vote out the traitor penguin.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll play as one of three roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udc27 Villagers \u2013 complete tasks and survive the vampire(s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udddb Vampires \u2013 deceive, sabotage, and kill every villager.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udd21 The Joker \u2013  cause maximum chaos and convince the villagers to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confession chambers, emergency meetings, sudden betrayals and endless accusations. This is not a house of peace\u2014this is a church full of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/83cc31dae28e53c137eec22c4c29112b.poster.avif?t=1752600612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/83cc31dae28e53c137eec22c4c29112b.webm?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/83cc31dae28e53c137eec22c4c29112b.mp4?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play with 4\u201312 players online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Bluff, betray, or become a legend in the church*  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Colorful penguins.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/536580402e099b55c125c2e900ef0de4.poster.avif?t=1752600612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/536580402e099b55c125c2e900ef0de4.webm?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/536580402e099b55c125c2e900ef0de4.mp4?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>\u00a0Church Crew</strong>\u00a0is a chaotic 4\u201312 player online social deduction game where penguins gather inside a  church to complete tasks, expose hidden threats, and vote out the traitor penguin.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll play as one of three roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udc27 Villagers \u2013 complete tasks and survive the vampire(s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udddb Vampires \u2013 deceive, sabotage, and kill every villager.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udd21 The Joker \u2013  cause maximum chaos and convince the villagers to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confession chambers, emergency meetings, sudden betrayals and endless accusations. This is not a house of peace\u2014this is a church full of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/83cc31dae28e53c137eec22c4c29112b.poster.avif?t=1752600612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/83cc31dae28e53c137eec22c4c29112b.webm?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766740/extras/83cc31dae28e53c137eec22c4c29112b.mp4?t=1752600612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play with 4\u201312 players online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Bluff, betray, or become a legend in the church*  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc27 Colorful penguins.</p>",
